="Paragraph3">Power'd by Nature's Pros since 1970.</p><p class="sc-jlGhtx jCFvsE pf-24_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-iQbOXA hQbCed pf-26_">Since 1970, the professionals who work the land have shaped everything we do. What started as Russo Ace Hardware, a family-owned franchise, evolved into Russo Power Equipment as our focus shifted to outdoor power. Today, as Russo Outdoor Power Plus, our name reflects the full scope of who we serve: landscapers, municipalities, park districts, turf care specialists, arborists, landowners, and snow removal companies across Illinois, Wisconsin, Indiana, and Iowa.<br><br>The name has changed over the years, but the foundation hasn't. We're still here to provide the best outdoor power equipment, snow removal tools, and turf care machinery while holding onto the family values we were built on. No matter the location, no matter the season, we show up for the pros who power us.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-383a" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-jwZJYP bRHccV pf-27_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-boZfnm jvQCDP"><div class="sc-jaXxZZ iGFmwC pf-28_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:5px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dUYKzm kWVCJl pf-29_"><div class="sc-fulBNO hPRaTN pf-30_ pf-r pf-r-ew pf-c-ct pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;--s-sm:2.5px;--ew-xs:5;--ew-md:10" data-pf-type="ContentList"><div class="pf-c"><div data-pf-type="ContentListItem" class="sc-kMriOJ fXvsAS rid-383ae8d7"><div class="sc-jaXxZZ iGFmwC rid-3ae8d799 pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:5px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dUYKzm kWVCJl rid-e8d799c9"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/t/25/assets/icon_ope-1681504211944_45x.png?v=168