-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-238_ pf-text-1">Russo Ace Hardware opens in Chicago, IL on Montrose Ave.</li></ul><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-240_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">1998</p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-izQAGL hEywwZ pf-242_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-243_ pf-text-1">The first Russo Power Equipment location is opened on Dakin Ave. in Dunning Square on Chicago's northwest side.</li></ul><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-245_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">2000</p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-izQAGL hEywwZ pf-247_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-248_ pf-text-1">RussoPower.com website is launched.</li></ul><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-250_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">2005</p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-izQAGL hEywwZ pf-252_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-253_ pf-text-1">New Russo Facility in Schiller Park, IL. We grew faster than we thought, so we boxed up Dakin store and moved to Schiller Park, a bigger location to serve customers better.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-255_ pf-text-1">Launched Dealer Software Ideal Systems</li></ul><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-257_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">2008</p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-izQAGL hEywwZ pf-259_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-260_ pf-text-1">New Russo Facility in Naperville, IL</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-262_ pf-text-1">First Bulk Salt Site in Lemont, IL</li></ul><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-264_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">2011</p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-izQAGL hEywwZ pf-266_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-267_ pf-text-1">New Russo Facility in Hainesville, IL</li></ul><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-269_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">2014</p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-izQAGL hEywwZ pf-271_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-272_ pf-text-1">New Russo Facility in Frankfort, IL</li></ul><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-274_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">2016</p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-izQAGL hEywwZ pf-276_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-277_ pf-text-1">New Russo Facility in Elgin, IL</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-279_ pf-text-1">New Russo E-commerce Fulfillment Center in Elgin, IL</li></ul><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-281_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">2019</p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-izQAGL hEywwZ pf-283_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-284_ pf-text-1">Dealer Software upgrade to ERP System NAV Dynamics</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-286_ pf-text-1">Second Bulk Salt Site in Lemont, IL</li></ul><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-288_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">2020</p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-izQAGL hEywwZ pf-290_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-291_ pf-text-1">Digital Evolution Investment</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-293_ pf-text-1">Third Bulk Salt Site in Lemont, IL</li></ul><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-295_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">2022</p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-izQAGL hEywwZ pf-297_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-298_ pf-text-1">RussoPower.com Website UI/UX Redesign</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-300_ pf-text-1">Acquired C&amp;C Distributors located in Fort Wayne &amp; South Bend,&nbsp;Indiana, and are&nbsp;Powered by Russo branches</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-jBeCGk eqIIjI pf-302_ pf-text-1">Acquired Porters Lawn &amp; Power Equipment located in Janesville,&nbsp;WI, and is a Powered by Russo branch</li><li data-pf-type="List2.I